          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <h1>\n      Dominic Lee Resume\n    </h1>\n    \n    <p>I am interested in working as a web designer for a local business.</p>\n    \n    <h2>\n      Technical Skills\n    </h2>\n    \n    <ul>\n      <li>Basic web coding skills in HTML and CSS</li>\n      <li>Installing new software on computers</li>\n      <li>Setting up wireless networks</li>\n    </ul>\n    \n    <h2>\n      Workplace Skills\n    </h2>\n\n    <ul>\n      <li>On time</li>\n      <li>Breaks large projects down into smaller tasks</li>\n      <li>Can work on a team and collaborate with others</li>\n    </ul>\n    \n    <h2>\n      References\n    </h2>\n    \n    <ol>\n      <li>Mr Sanchez - Computer Science Teacher</li>\n      <li>Ms Hutchison - Tennis Coach</li>\n      <li>Toni Stevens - Current Employer (babysitting)</li>\n    </ol>\n    \n  </body>\n</html>",
